WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
[Soft piano and interface sounds]
Every hand adds a filter.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.000
MK Talent Atlas. Your hiring desk.
Fictional demo workspace.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Define the role and role-related skills.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Plan the source. Market context informs outreach,
never a ranking of people.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Permission first.
This is a demo application.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Evidence, not appearances.
The checkerboard tiles are the same shade.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Review the evidence.
Labels describe a human review status.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:56.000
One rubric. For everyone.
The two central circles are the same size.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Assess the work against a consistent rubric.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:12.000
A human reviews and saves the reasoning.
Saving never contacts the candidate.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:18.000
Local records. Exports. Light and dark views.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:22.000
In development: provider connections and AI agents.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:30.000
MK Talent Atlas. Closer to the source.
[The piano resolves and fades]
